sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as TrackController (wayside)
    participant V as attached vital code
    participant M as SwTrackController
    participant H as Central Harness
    participant TM as Track Model
    Note over W,V: Within a scan (UC-09), after the program has set AUTH_n.
    W->>V: AUTH_n, CLOSED_n, the switch on the block moving
    V->>V: OUT_AUTH_n := AUTH_n AND NOT CLOSED_n AND NOT moving
    V-->>W: OUT_AUTH_n, OUT_HALF_n
    loop each block the CTC suggested something for
        alt OUT_AUTH_n
            W->>W: OS encode: the suggestion, speed halved if OUT_HALF_n
        else not
            W->>W: OS encode: speed 0, authority 0
        end
    end
    W-->>M: track_circuits
    M-->>H: commanded speed (whole m/s) and authority (blocks), per block
    H->>TM: track circuit commands
    Note right of TM: The train in the block gets them. A lower speed or authority is what brakes the train.
